<title>USA: Health Care Property raises dividend.</title>
<headline>Health Care Property raises dividend.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Health Care Property Investors Inc said it increased its quarterly dividend to $0.60 per share from $0.59.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable February 20 to shareholders of record February 3.</p>
</text>
